<section id="how-it-works" class="page-section loop-section">
  <div class="section-heading split-heading">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">01 / The loop</div>
      <h2>Three commands.<br /><em>One growing collection.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p>Every session is short, deliberate, and saved between invocations. Make a choice, see what the wild gives back, then decide what stays.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <article class="step-card card">
      <div class="step-number">01</div>
      <div class="step-icon icon-radar">◌</div>
      <h3>Hunt the unknown</h3>
      <p>Run <code>hunt</code> to generate one wild encounter. A successful hunt grants 5 XP and replaces the pending encounter.</p>
      <div class="step-foot"><span class="badge badge-soft">15 second cooldown</span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="step-card card step-featured">
      <div class="step-number">02</div>
      <div class="step-icon icon-ball">◉</div>
      <h3>Choose your angle</h3>
      <p>Pick a ball that fits the moment. Type, speed, time of day, ownership, and stats can all change the odds.</p>
      <div class="step-foot"><span class="badge badge-soft">11 ball types</span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="step-card card">
      <div class="step-number">03</div>
      <div class="step-icon icon-star">✦</div>
      <h3>Build your dex</h3>
      <p>Catch to earn XP, unlock better supplies, and see your collection grow. Sell surplus catches when you need a refill.</p>
      <div class="step-foot"><span class="badge badge-soft">local save file</span></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
